        {
          "name": "Ronin",
          "expression": "closed",
          "pose": "bow"
        }
      ],
      "on_screen_text": null,
      "narration": "At the temple, they washed Kira's head in a well and placed it in front of Asano's grave. Their master's revenge was complete.",
      "word_count": 23
    },
    {
      "id": "shot-36",
      "section": "The walk to Sengaku-ji",
      "start": 448,
      "duration": 4,
