          "pose": "stand"
        }
      ],
      "on_screen_text": "Chūshingura",
      "narration": "Within a few decades, their story became Japan's most famous play, Chūshingura, \"The Treasury of Loyal Retainers.\" It has been retold in theater, movies and TV ever since.",
      "word_count": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "shot-44",
